{{/*
Files that chezmoi used to manage and no longer does. Chezmoi never removes a
target it has stopped managing, so without this they survive forever on every
machine that applied an earlier revision.

These three are not merely stale, they are harmful. `conf.d` is sourced eagerly
at every Fish startup, so 50-functions.fish re-defines the same wrappers that
now live in `functions/` as autoloaded definitions. An eager definition wins
over autoloading, which means an affected machine silently runs the OLD
implementations and never picks up any fix made in this repository.

Retired in 6c29182 ("Harden dotfiles reliability and privacy"). The one wrapper
with no autoloaded replacement, `bun`, has been restored as
dot_config/fish/functions/bun.fish. The `python` / `python3` wrappers are
deliberately not restored: safe-chain guards package installation, and the
install paths are already covered by pip, pip3, pipx, uv and poetry.
*/ -}}
.config/fish/conf.d/50-functions.fish
.config/fish/conf.d/80-prompt-state.fish
.config/fish/conf.d/zz-startup-timer.fish
